  "text": "Studio AI is built on more than 120 sources of wedding industry research, customer behaviour data, conversion best practice and real-world venue performance. Drawing on insights from Bridebook, Hitched, Google, Salesforce, HubSpot, Harvard Business Review and our own wedding venue benchmark research. Because better results don't come from guesswork, they come from understanding what today's couples actually respond to. Studio AI analyses what's working, identifies what's not, and helps you improve every stage of the couple journey. From first impression, to first enquiry, to booked tour, six AI-powered tools. One goal, more venue tours, more bookings, more weddings.",
